  "headword": "{増幅|ぞうふく}",
  "reading": "ぞうふく",
  "part_of_speech": "noun, suru verb",
  "gloss": "amplification",
  "definitions": [
    {
      "sense_number": 1,
      "gloss": "amplification, intensification",
      "explanation": "The act of making something larger, stronger, or more intense. Originally a technical term for increasing the amplitude of an electrical signal or sound, but also used figuratively for the intensification of emotions, fears, or effects."
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "id": "12144_zoufuku_ex1",
      "japanese": "{音|おと}を{増幅|ぞうふく}する。",
      "english": "To amplify sound.",
      "notes": null,
      "has_audio": false,
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "12144_zoufuku_ex2",
      "japanese": "SNSがうわさを{増幅|ぞうふく}させた。",
      "english": "Social media amplified the rumor.",
      "notes": null,
      "has_audio": false,
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "12144_zoufuku_ex3",
      "japanese": "メディアの{報道|ほうどう}が{人々|ひとびと}の{不安|ふあん}を{増幅|ぞうふく}させ、パニックにつながった。",
      "english": "Media coverage amplified people's anxiety, leading to panic.",
      "notes": null,
      "has_audio": false,
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ]
    }
  ],
  "notes": "USAGE:\n{増幅|ぞうふく} can be used both technically (electronics, audio) and figuratively (emotions, social phenomena). In its figurative use, it often describes how something negative — fear, anxiety, rumors — gets magnified, especially through media or social dynamics.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {音|おと}を{増幅|ぞうふく}する: to amplify sound\n- {信号|しんごう}を{増幅|ぞうふく}する: to amplify a signal\n- {不安|ふあん}を{増幅|ぞうふく}させる: to amplify anxiety\n- {増幅|ぞうふく}{器|き}: amplifier (device)",
